# Build-time configuration for the deployed site.
#
# Committed on purpose. Cloudflare builds this site from the repo with `npm run build`,
# and Vite inlines VITE_* variables at build time -- so anything not present here has to
# be set by hand in the Cloudflare dashboard, where it is invisible to the repo and to
# anyone reading it. That gap is exactly what went wrong: the variable was never set, so
# every build silently fell back to the bundled snapshot and the site served an
# 11-day-old catalogue of 12 sources while the live bucket held 15.
#
# This is not a secret. It is Cloudflare R2's public origin for the public bucket -- the
# same URL already embedded in the publicly served catalogue.json, and the address any
# reader points DuckDB at. The bucket holds only redistributable sources; publish_public
# excludes tiingo and yfinance.
VITE_PUBLIC_BASE_URL=https://pub-4eb5f43e1359436fb0ce32dc47ce5cc6.r2.dev
